501f86f5b13f47 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは！オリジナルキャラクターのイラストをお願いしたいです。私は淑女（お嬢様）の格好をしたほうがいいです。彼女の年齢は27歳です。ポーズと服装...あとは好きなようにやってください、ありがとう！デスクトップの壁紙に設定したり、プロフィール写真に使用したりなど、個人的な用途で使用したいと考えています。以下、参考に添付しておきます。ご検討いただきありがとうございます！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/1/folders/1GI_0OPr8n-HvxuOfRjxNZlicqqN2udu1", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@zombieheadline/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1943740, "client_id": 192290, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fbadc267/uploads/origins/3dc07188-d6f5-4ea7-8ab5-2fba8aca07a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c45fc8bcdc7088a91d7a7b7df552226f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fbadc267/uploads/origins/3dc07188-d6f5-4ea7-8ab5-2fba8aca07a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c45fc8bcdc7088a91d7a7b7df552226f, https://si.imgix.net/fbadc267/uploads/origins/3dc07188-d6f5-4ea7-8ab5-2fba8aca07a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=32206c1a0e90b2febb38cc6c5d3a6dd4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fbadc267/uploads/origins/3dc07188-d6f5-4ea7-8ab5-2fba8aca07a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=86e0e885017060c38f77f7d26694d19d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fbadc267/uploads/origins/3dc07188-d6f5-4ea7-8ab5-2fba8aca07a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e5fbfa2ad275819321590c3c9e879db3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fbadc267/uploads/origins/3dc07188-d6f5-4ea7-8ab5-2fba8aca07a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e5fbfa2ad275819321590c3c9e879db3, https://si.imgix.net/fbadc267/uploads/origins/3dc07188-d6f5-4ea7-8ab5-2fba8aca07a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9a476077308c21979e0f35e899912e5c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fbadc267/uploads/origins/3dc07188-d6f5-4ea7-8ab5-2fba8aca07a4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6d91929ace836dd513e9f707c258f84a 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは、私はあなたの画風がとても好きです!あなたの描くキャラクターは、とてもきれいでかわいいと思います。私のオリジナルキャラクターのイラストをお願いしたいです。\n\n🪶キャラクターの詳細です。30歳。身長178cm。金髪。緑色の目。ワシのような茶色の翼を持っている。翼を描くかどうかは自由。優しくて温かいお姉さんのような雰囲気がある。元グラディエーターで、自由を手に入れ、世界を自由に旅している。男性の体型。\n\n和風な服装を希望します。B01と書かれた服装か、それに近いデザインで描いてください。アクセサリーなども自由につけてください。\n\nありがとうございました。お気に召さない場合は、お断りすることもございます。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1I0jBC53EoTQVE-sI2K8Jh37JWByFLuur", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@zombieheadline/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1943740, "client_id": 829593, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8b307dbb/uploads/origins/be9731e7-473f-4f61-8215-2da13be03b5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2e58740f8c45971b308265b1c33aa412", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8b307dbb/uploads/origins/be9731e7-473f-4f61-8215-2da13be03b5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2e58740f8c45971b308265b1c33aa412, https://si.imgix.net/8b307dbb/uploads/origins/be9731e7-473f-4f61-8215-2da13be03b5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a5e08ff8fd24f657edb3fbdf5e896bbe 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8b307dbb/uploads/origins/be9731e7-473f-4f61-8215-2da13be03b5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f27b5bdcc2992d7705a0027ec83690e7 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8b307dbb/uploads/origins/be9731e7-473f-4f61-8215-2da13be03b5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fde8d4d118bdc6bd24d461c54a6b242c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8b307dbb/uploads/origins/be9731e7-473f-4f61-8215-2da13be03b5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fde8d4d118bdc6bd24d461c54a6b242c, https://si.imgix.net/8b307dbb/uploads/origins/be9731e7-473f-4f61-8215-2da13be03b5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b49be331e99a6a19d29d6b0fac02164d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8b307dbb/uploads/origins/be9731e7-473f-4f61-8215-2da13be03b5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=189bb9ab55966bd8e3466cb78a294178 3x"}, "body": "Hey Numsan! \n\nI really like a lot of the work you have drawn. I think your color palettes are really pretty! \n\nI was curious if you would be willing to draw our OC pairing? \n\nThe characters are Khimi and Lumi. They are partners who travel through the desert together. \n\nThey often find themselves immersed in trouble or difficulty but usually make it out alright. \n\nKhimi is a more serious figure, though he can be more gentle and playful around Lumi. \n\nLumi is mischievous and fun. He is energetic when he is awake but often sleeps for most of the day when he can afford to. \n\nI don't have any poses in mind for the characters, so you're welcome to draw whatever comes to mind. \n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/MuZv5Ie", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 603033, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "evi", "screen_name": "evina_ic", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1953836155973304320/wQ8pvp82.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1046368761899417601/1721227069/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank":